    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In Spellbound Shuffle, embark into a fantasy realm threatened by mystical creatures. Leave behind the tired conventions of traditional deckbuilders and dive headfirst into a tactical roguelike experience where every move, every card, and every choice holds the key to victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/0235303ac272c2507ba7e378dc38dd8d.poster.avif?t=1725816539\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/0235303ac272c2507ba7e378dc38dd8d.webm?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/0235303ac272c2507ba7e378dc38dd8d.mp4?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features :</h2><br><strong>\ud83c\udccf Build your deck \ud83c\udccf</strong><br>Begin your adventure as a humble hero armed with a basic deck of cards. As you progress through combats, seize the opportunity to build and customize your deck with powerful, game-changing cards and augments. Choose your path wisely, as the strategic decisions you make will shape your run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/d132ed305b127a4c619ee921a79ff2cc.poster.avif?t=1725816539\" width=524 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/d132ed305b127a4c619ee921a79ff2cc.webm?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/d132ed305b127a4c619ee921a79ff2cc.mp4?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Master Tactical Combat \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</strong><br>Engage in tactical grid-based combat that will push your wits to the limit. Position your hero strategically, deploy your cards with precision, and outsmart your enemies with clever combos. Victory is not just about power; it's about strategy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/02c008a9edc2d729e2aeaa9f8386e0c2.poster.avif?t=1725816539\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/02c008a9edc2d729e2aeaa9f8386e0c2.webm?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/02c008a9edc2d729e2aeaa9f8386e0c2.mp4?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfae Infinite Replayability \ud83c\udfae</strong><br>Every run is a fresh adventure, with procedurally generated levels and a staggering variety of cards to discover. The possibilities are endless, ensuring that no two playthroughs are ever the same. Embrace the challenge and revel in the thrill of infinite replayability.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/2af9bcb79127ebee1d34e73feeb8551d.poster.avif?t=1725816539\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/2af9bcb79127ebee1d34e73feeb8551d.webm?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604210/extras/2af9bcb79127ebee1d34e73feeb8551d.mp4?t=1725816539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
